│ This patch modifies render_doc to consistently add parentheses     │
│ around optional parameters when generating the HTML. It also       │
│ modifies format_parameter to ensure that optional parameters are   │
│ consistently formatted with parentheses. This addresses the visual │
│ inconsistency described in the issue.                              │
